  {
    "slide": 34,
    "xml_sha256": "532f1e5be7ae182e781eb64181ebdf7a47cd96949470b6a3321a6dba3c1673cf",
    "text": "Most cloning-based research has focused on cloning individual cells, tissues and organs from \nstem cells \n(cells that have not yet become specialized)… \nWhat might be some useful applications of  this research???\nExtra: Stem Cell Research",
    "relations": [
      {
        "Id": "rId1",
        "Type": "http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships/slideLayout",
