  {
    "slide": 46,
    "xml_sha256": "13893e61918f59dd91739cd0df75551da61503c782e270e612afed8f860fe652",
    "text": "Independent Assortment\n(more on this in Chapter 17 as well)\nIncreases gamete diversity due to number of potential chromosome combinations",
    "relations": [
